# ASI — Artifact System Integration (4-Plane)
# Authority: CSA-sealed

## 1. Canonical 4-Plane Integration

```text
                    CONA (Executor-Py)
                         │
        ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
        │                │                │
        ▼                ▼                ▼
   ┌─────────┐     ┌──────────┐    ┌────────────┐
   │ ASSEMBLE│     │ INTEGRATE│    │ VERIFY     │
   └────┬────┘     └────┬─────┘    └─────┬──────┘
        │               │                │
        ▼               ▼                ▼
   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │           CRYSTALLIZE                   │
   │    (FEH + ALR sealed artifact)          │
   └─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## 2. Four Planes

### PLANE 1: ASSEMBLE (Import → Wire)
```yaml
assemble:
  source: "T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-cep (Rust DNA)"
  target: "T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-py (Python mirror)"
  method: "1:1 trait/struct mirror via DNA registry"
  imports:
    - "ExecuteParticle trait → executor_py.ExecuteParticle (ABC)"
    - "IpoFeature trait → executor_py.IpoFeature (ABC)"
    - "CaporRouter trait → executor_py.CaporRouter (ABC)"
    - "RacRouter trait → executor_py.RacRouter (ABC)"
    - "SepiProof struct → executor_py.SepiProof (dataclass)"
    - "FanId/FanCapability → executor_py.FanId/FanCapability (dataclass)"
    - "RacUri V4 parser → executor_py.RacUri (dataclass)"
    - "RacTransport trait → executor_py.RacTransport (ABC)"
```

### PLANE 2: INTEGRATE (Wire → Runtime)
```yaml
integrate:
  actor_binding: "text-ractor → executor-py (MCV Controller)"
  fan_registration: "FanRegistry auto-registers on import"
  dna_registration: "ExecutorDNARegistry auto-registers on import"
  transport_binding:
    - "FDI → LocalNativeAdapter → hace-lion-machine"
    - "FPI → StdioIpcAdapter → hace-rion-machine"
    - "HTTP → HttpBridgeAdapter → hace-rion-machine"
    - "gRPC → GrpcBridgeAdapter → hace-rion-machine"
  hookpoint_binding: "hok://executor-py/* → IpoOrchestrator phases"
```

### PLANE 3: VERIFY (Test → Audit)
```yaml
verify:
  rota_tests:
    - "test_core_types.py: ExecuteParticle, ExecContext, SepiProof"
    - "test_ipo_pipeline.py: input→process→output flow"
    - "test_capor_resolution.py: WHAT capacity resolution"
    - "test_racor_resolution.py: HOW/WHERE route resolution"
    - "test_fdi_transport.py: wired autoload (USB/cable)"
    - "test_fpi_transport.py: wireless discovery (bluetooth/NFC)"
    - "test_evidence_sealing.py: FEH + ALR on every execute"
    - "test_actor_executor_mapping.py: text-ractor → executor-py"
  smoke_tests:
    - "_mcp_wiring_smoke.py equivalent for executor-py"
  conformance:
    - "1:1 trait mapping with executor-cep (Rust)"
    - "SIO-FPI v1 envelope compliance"
    - "RAC URI V4 grammar compliance"
    - "FEH/ALR sealing on every CAP invocation"
```

### PLANE 4: CRYSTALLIZE (Seal → Distribute)
```yaml
crystallize:
  artifact: "hace-executor-py-{version}.pyz"
  location: "T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-py/release/"
  seal:
    - "FEH hash of all source + tests + canon"
    - "ALR entry in Archetype Ledger"
    - "CSA signature on final/canon.ail"
  distribution:
    - "T:/CAW/partners/hace/bin/hace-executor-py/"
    - "T:/workspaces/hace-rosa/forge/ (as dependency)"
    - "PyPI: hace-executor-py"
  promotion_gate:
    - "ROTA: 33+ tests PASS"
    - "CSA seal on final/canon.ail"
    - "CVA audit: FEH/ALR verified"
```

## 3. Integration Points

```yaml
integration_points:
  upstream:
    - "hace/sdk/executor-cep (Rust DNA source)"
    - "hace/actor/.know/docs/actor-executor.ail (Actor contract)"
    - "hace/text-editor/.know/rc/rac-contracts.ail (RAC contracts)"
    - "hace/io/rac/ (Transport DNA)"
  
  downstream:
    - "py-text-editor (registers FanCapability)"
    - "hace-rosa/forge/hace-cep-resolver (uses executor-py DNA)"
    - "hace-rosa/forge/hace-lion-machine (local native runtime)"
    - "hace-rosa/forge/hace-rion-machine (remote native runtime)"
    - "hace-rosa/forge/hace-sio-stream (streaming transport)"
  
  lateral:
    - "executor-rs (Rust native particles)"
    - "executor-go / executor-ts / executor-php / executor-dart (polyglot)"
```

